      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "non-functional requirements\n1- Performance for crud and search p99 < 150ms, for skill-gap ,matching enginne and roadmap p95 < 2S\n2-system must prenvent duplicates\n3- strong consistency for applications\n4- guarantee at least one delivery for notifications\n5- read Scalabililty : system is more read skewed so read replicas and caching is needed",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
